# Browser — ego-browser (Ego Lite) only

SoT: `~/.cstack/src/docs/BROWSER.md` (Chase lock 2026-11-04).

- Tool: **`ego-browser` TaskSpace only** (`~/.agents/skills/ego-browser`).
  Run `ego-browser nodejs <<'EOF' … EOF`. One `taskSpace("<job>")` per job,
  print `spaceId`, resume with `taskSpace(<id>)`. Work in the space’s own
  tab (`p1`); never adopt/drive Chase’s live tab. `page.snapshot()` → act
  (`@ref` / `loc=css:` / CSS) → fresh snapshot → `page.screenshot({ path })`.
  `task.finish({ keep: [] })` when done.
- Forbidden: launching or driving Chrome/Chromium yourself (`open -a`,
  `osascript`, `--remote-debugging-port`, temp `--user-data-dir`,
  `connectOverCDP`, Playwright/Puppeteer `launch()`), `aside`, Cursor
  `browser_*` tools. Only exception: a repo’s own automated test suite run by
  its own runner. Do not kill Chrome processes you did not start.
- Verify after your own work: locally first, then dev after the dev deploy.
- Dev (`www.dev.sume.com`) / prod (`www.sume.com`): **sumelabs workspace
  only**; compose model **Auto**. Not sumelabs → STOP.
